# Butler Routes - Desolace completionist pilot (pack butler-routes-completionist).
# Every Desolace quest in the local census (56 quests, docs/desolace-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept; every one with a turn-in in the data turns in
# once (92754 has no turn-in in the data and is accept-only, documented).
# Nijel's Point opens in the north (Vahlarriel, Kreldig, the Karnitol and Rackmore
# finds), then the Magram (east) and Gelkis (west) clan chains run through the one
# Kolkar camp they share, then the kodo country, the coast and the south. Expedition
# legs carry the chains that leave the zone. Chain order is strictly turn-in-before-
# accept; the complete for the quest whose pre sits outside every contract rides in
# a dedicated when onquest mini-step. Coordinates on Desolace use the era frame;
# expedition stops use the era frame too, set with zone map lines. The Horde side
# belongs to the Horde block.
guide butler-routes-completionist/desolace
title Desolace - Completionist
levels 30-40
zone Desolace
category Leveling
folder Completionist
keywords desolace, completionist, nijel's point, maraudon, centaur
coords live
version 1

step Nijel's Point - arrival

  tip Nijel's Point (66.66, 10.93): Captain Pentigast holds the north wall, Kreldig Ungor (66.2, 9.63) and Vahlarriel Demonslayer (66.44, 11.82) work beside him. Dalinda Malem (54.86, 26.13) waits down the slope.
  note 1439's pre (1438 Vahlarriel's Search, done in Stonetalon) fills before this route - take 1439 here.
  accept 1439 only Alliance -- Search for Tyranis - Dalinda Malem; Tyranis' Pendant, the slope below
  accept 93224 only Alliance -- Carved Centaur Totems - Captain Pentigast; Kolkar totems, the camp below
  note 1465's starter (the Malem Chest) and 1455's starter (Karnitol's Chest) lie on the slope below - take them there.
  note 6161's starter (Rackmore's Log) lies on the slope below - take it there.

